  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">[Do Not Use] Design costs for Ending Preventable Deaths of mothers, babies and children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme will contribute to the overall FCDO EPD approach that aims to reduce the maternal, newborn and child mortality by 5-15% in 11 countries by 2025 (to be decided dependant on global projections).  It will do this through improvements of 5% in a set of key indicators compiled into a &#x2018;Universal Health Coverage Index&#x2019; in the same countries.   

The outcome will be increased country commitment and capability on EPD.  This will be achieved through strengthened government and civil society institutions, policy reforms, improved coordination of investments and greater use of evidence. The programme will galvanise action across the FCDO network, linking our global influence with country action.  The estimated cost is up to &#xa3;15m.</narrative>
  </description>
